1
00:00:00,058 --> 00:00:01,768
(Leonard:)Terrible.

2
00:00:01,935 --> 00:00:04,395
(Leonard:)I worked really hard on that project.

3
00:00:04,563 --> 00:00:07,653
(Leonard:)I stayed up all night singing
the clown's aria from Pagliacci...

4
00:00:07,816 --> 00:00:10,486
(Leonard:)...to a lima bean sprout.

5
00:00:11,737 --> 00:00:13,567
(Sheldon:)Go on.

6
00:00:14,907 --> 00:00:16,487
(Leonard:)It wasn't my fault.

7
00:00:16,658 --> 00:00:18,618
(Leonard:)I had never seen
my brother's project.

8
00:00:18,785 --> 00:00:20,825
(Leonard:)And my mother could've told me
before...

9
00:00:21,038 --> 00:00:24,748
(Leonard:)...instead of at the ceremony
in front of everyone.

10
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:29,090
(Sheldon:)So I hear you saying you're angry
with your mother.

11
00:00:30,255 --> 00:00:33,345
(Leonard:)Damn right,
I'm angry with my mother.

12
00:00:34,301 --> 00:00:36,301
[SNIFFLING]

13
00:00:38,513 --> 00:00:41,433
(Leonard:)For God's sake,
I was 8 years old.

14
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,640
(Leonard:)She humiliated me.

15
00:00:42,809 --> 00:00:45,559
(Leonard:)That's when the bed-wetting
started again.

16
00:00:48,523 --> 00:00:50,943
(Sheldon:)-Thank you, Leonard.
-For what?

17
00:00:51,109 --> 00:00:53,359
(Sheldon:)If someone as damaged as you
can find his way...

18
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:55,360
(Sheldon:)...to crawl out of bed each morning...

19
00:00:55,572 --> 00:00:59,022
(Sheldon:)...I think I can face
a simple awards ceremony.

